{"id":"61a5bbf642ba9c20","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-monad.md","title":"Definition — 单子及其单位、乘法","display":"Definition — 单子及其单位、乘法","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-monad","aliases":["14-df-monad"],"display":"Definition — 单子及其单位、乘法","source_ref":"IV.4, pp.176–177; DjVu 94","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-functor]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-monad"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-monad</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 单子及其单位、乘法"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IV.4, pp.176–177; DjVu 94"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(T:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为函子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow T\">\\(\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:T\\circ T\\Rightarrow T\">\\(\\mu:T\\circ T\\Rightarrow T\\)</span> 为带源靶的自然变换候选。函子复合、恒等和分量记号沿用本书基础原子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{IsMonad}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\eta,\\mu)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},T)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\mu,T\\circ T,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(\\mu_A\\circ T(\\mu_A)=\\mu_A\\circ\\mu_{T(A)}\\land\\mu_A\\circ T(\\eta_A)=\\operatorname{id}_{T(A)}\\land\\mu_A\\circ\\eta_{T(A)}=\\operatorname{id}_{T(A)}\\bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{IsMonad}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\eta,\\mu)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},T)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\mu,T\\circ T,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(\\mu_A\\circ T(\\mu_A)=\\mu_A\\circ\\mu_{T(A)}\\land\\mu_A\\circ T(\\eta_A)=\\operatorname{id}_{T(A)}\\land\\mu_A\\circ\\eta_{T(A)}=\\operatorname{id}_{T(A)}\\bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>乘法两侧的定义域均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^3A\">\\(T^3A\\)</span>、值域均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"TA\">\\(TA\\)</span>；两个单位等式定义域和值域均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"TA\">\\(TA\\)</span>。显式列出两条单位律，避免仅凭“类似幺半群”留下缺口。单子是原书证明初等拓扑斯有限余极限时所需的辅助构造。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，IV.4, pp.176–177。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"T:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu:T\\circ T\\Rightarrow T","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{IsMonad}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\eta,\\mu)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},T)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\mu,T\\circ T,T)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(\\mu_A\\circ T(\\mu_A)=\\mu_A\\circ\\mu_{T(A)}\\land\\mu_A\\circ T(\\eta_A)=\\operatorname{id}_{T(A)}\\land\\mu_A\\circ\\eta_{T(A)}=\\operatorname{id}_{T(A)}\\bigr).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T^3A","display":false},{"tex":"TA","display":false},{"tex":"TA","display":false}],"bytes":1765,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-306","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monad|df-211 — 单子及其单位、乘法]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monad]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monad]]"},{"id":"e28e85e